{
  "title": "Amazingly Grilled Canadian Beef Skewers",
  "description": "Grassy and chewy Canadian dish featuring dutch stroop, perfect for a date night, and fodmap friendly. This recipe uses a yakimono grill for a unique flavor.",
  "cuisine": "Canadian",
